      "en_US": [
        "Yay! I got a Pal Pad at the\n",
        "Pokémon Wi-Fi Club downstairs!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0897_SC03PC0101_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "Switch on the PC at any Pokémon\n",
        "Center and connect to the\\fPokémon Storage System.\r",
        "That’s all you need to do to store\n",
        "or bring out your Pokémon."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0897_SC03PC0101_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "Hmmm...\r",
        "What is your favorite kind of\n",
        "Trainer? Can you tell me?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0897_SC03PC0101_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "Which kind of Trainer would you like\n",
        "to be?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0897_SC03PC0101_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 14, 0, 0} is the kind of\n",
        "Trainer you want to be?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0897_SC03PC0101_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "I see! So {STRVAR_1 14, 0, 0} is the\n",
        "kind of Trainer you like.\r",
        "If that’s the case, others may come\n",
        "to see you in the same way.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0897_SC03PC0101_00006",
      "en_US": "OK, then I’ll just talk to you later!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0897_SC03PC0101_00007",
      "en_US": [
